					only_from_crafting: false
				}
			]
			description: ["{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/f195c5d160d5600110121b22.png width:32 height:32 align:center}" "已有怪奇宝典，或能制作独立指南。" "能区分说明与构件配方。" "分别准备电力、氧气和火箭零件。"]
		}
		{
			id: "18607CD35178CF9C"
			title: "准备液态氧物流"
			icon: "minecraft:book"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -4.15d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "0270F0D372D4FE90"
					type: "checkmark"
					title: "完成操作"
				}
			]
			description: [
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/7fe944acc7f2dfb9f21c91ae.png width:32 height:32 align:center}"
				"{image:expedition_research:textures/quests/97c3a15e16a6e25cb0bd28bc.png width:240 height:97 align:center}"
				"已有可产氧的机器和气体/流体转换能力。"
				"选择旋转冷凝器的冷凝模式，将Mekanism氧气变成同名液态氧。气体管和流体管分别接对储罐。"
				"获得流体 氧气。它与化学品气态氧不是同一检测目标。"
				"将液态氧接入氧气装载机。也可查光合反应液精炼的独立路线。"
			]
		}
		{
			id: "1728AD7C502EDA85"
			title: "装配氧气装载机"
			icon: "ad_astra:oxygen_loader"
			x: -1.5d
			y: -4.15d
			optional: false
			tasks: [
				{
